---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Artwork from '../../components/Artwork.astro';
---

<Base pageKey="work-luxury-listings-dr">
<main>
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:26px 72px 0;font-size:13px;color:#A1A1AA">
  <a href="/" data-route="home" style="color:#A1A1AA">Home</a> <span style="color:#3F3F46">/</span> <a href="/work" data-route="work" style="color:#A1A1AA">Work</a> <span style="color:#3F3F46">/</span> <span style="color:#F8FAFC">Luxury Listings DR</span>
</nav>
<section data-hero="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:44px 72px 56px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:38px">
  <div data-row="" style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:48px">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;max-width:780px">
      <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Case study · Luxury Real Estate Platform</div>
      <h1 data-h1="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.03">Luxury Listings DR</h1>
      <p data-lead="" style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.65;color:#A1A1AA;max-width:640px;text-wrap:pretty">Luxury property discovery, made visual and unhurried. In development.</p>
      
    </div>
    <dl style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;margin:0;min-width:250px;font-size:13.5px">
      <div><dt style="color:#A1A1AA;margin-bottom:5px">Category</dt><dd style="margin:0">Luxury Real Estate Platform</dd></div>
      <div><dt style="color:#A1A1AA;margin-bottom:5px">Services</dt><dd style="margin:0;line-height:1.7">Web Design<br>User Experience<br>Responsive Design<br>Property-Discovery Structure<br>Lead-Inquiry Experience</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  <div data-art-id="luxury-listings-dr-case-study" data-art="" data-art-slot="" style="position:relative;height:520px;border-radius:26px;overflow:hidden;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:flex-end"><Artwork id="luxury-listings-dr-case-study" />
  <div data-art-note="" style="padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:560px">
    <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">ARTWORK — LUXURY LISTINGS DR CASE STUDY</span>
    <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#52525B">21:9 desktop · 16:9 tablet · 4:3 mobile · focal centre-right · lower third reserved · separate mobile render required</span>
  </div></div>
</section>

<section data-sect="" data-pad="" data-cols="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 90px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.25fr;gap:70px;align-items:start">
  <div data-sticky="" style="position:sticky;top:110px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Overview</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1">Property first. Everything else steps back.</h2></div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px">
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.85;color:#A1A1AA">Luxury buyers judge a property in seconds, and they judge the platform showing it just as fast. Luxury Listings DR needed a presentation equal to the inventory it carries.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.85;color:#A1A1AA">The structure lets visitors move between destinations and individual properties without ever losing the thread back to an inquiry. The project is currently in development.</p>
    <div style="padding:32px 34px;border-radius:22px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px">
      <h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:600">What made it difficult</h3>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Real estate platforms accumulate weight quickly: photography, categories, locations, filters and competing calls to action. Left unmanaged, that abundance reads as noise rather than choice.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">The brief asked for an elevated presentation that still gets someone from browsing to enquiry without friction.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="padding:32px 34px;border-radius:22px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px">
      <h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:600">How we worked</h3>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Destinations became the organising principle. From there, each property gets a focused page, responsive layouts and one obvious action rather than five competing ones.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Imagery leads. The interface stays quiet around it, and the content hierarchy does the explaining.</p>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section data-sect="" data-pad="" data-cols="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 90px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;align-items:center">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px">
    <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">The solution</div>
    <h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1">Built for discovery, aimed at enquiry.</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;color:#A1A1AA">A destination-led structure and a deliberately restrained interface keep attention where it belongs — on the property.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:6px"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Destination-led property discovery</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Responsive property presentation</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Clear navigation</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Focused property information</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Inquiry-oriented calls to action</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>A premium visual system suited to luxury real estate</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>A structure prepared for continued portfolio growth</span></div></div>
  </div>
  <div data-art-id="luxury-listings-dr-case-study-detail" data-art="" data-art-slot="" style="position:relative;height:560px;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:flex-end"><Artwork id="luxury-listings-dr-case-study-detail" />
  <div data-art-note="" style="padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:560px">
    <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">ARTWORK — LUXURY LISTINGS DR CASE STUDY — DETAIL</span>
    <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#52525B">Secondary crop of the same asset · 4:5 desktop · 3:2 mobile · no text overlap</span>
  </div></div>
</section>

<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 90px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">
  <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Outcome</div>
  <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:22px">
    <div style="padding:38px 40px;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(37,99,255,.08),rgba(139,92,246,.05)),#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.3)">
      <h2 data-h3="" data-rv="" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600">Outcome</h2>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;color:#F8FAFC">The approved direction gives the business a considered, well-organised foundation for presenting luxury property and guiding prospective buyers toward the right enquiry. Build is ongoing.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="padding:38px 40px;border-radius:24px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px">
      <h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:600">Selected interface sections</h3>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;margin-top:4px"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Destination overview</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Property listing and filtering</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Individual property presentation</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Inquiry and contact path</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:8px;flex:none"></span><span>Responsive navigation</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 80px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px" data-cols="">
  <a href="/work/create-studio" data-route="work-create-studio" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:32px 36px;border-radius:24px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.1);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;text-align:left">
    <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A1A1AA">← Previous project</span>
    <span style="font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Create Studio</span>
  </a>
  <a href="/work/joan-leonardo" data-route="work-joan-leonardo" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:32px 36px;border-radius:24px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.1);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;text-align:right;align-items:flex-end">
    <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A1A1AA">Next project →</span>
    <span style="font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Joan Leonardo</span>
  </a>
</section>

<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:0 72px 120px;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto">
  <div style="position:relative;padding:80px 60px;border-radius:28px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:22px">
    <h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:42px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.08;max-width:720px">Have something that deserves a better showing?</h2>
    <p data-lead="" style="margin:0;font-size:17px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7;max-width:600px">A new presence, a sharper brand, or a system designed around your operation — send the details and we’ll come back with the right next step.</p>
    <div data-row="" style="display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:4px"><a href="/contact" data-route="contact" data-btn-primary="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6,#2563FF);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:center">Discuss Your Project</a><a href="/work" data-route="work" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.16);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;text-align:center">Explore Our Work</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-slogan="" data-pad="" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding:104px 72px 120px;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;text-align:center">
  <p style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:54px;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.05;text-wrap:pretty">We Create. <span style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent">You Grow.</span></p>
</section>
</main>
</Base>
